.</p><p>Megan Gordon: So Always have workflows.</p><p>Bob Duncan: Yeah hundred percent hand on heart Yep. Perfect. Well then, can I?</p><p>Karen Lochhead: I said no because I didn&#x27;t do it.</p><p>Bob Duncan: But but I know you didn&#x27;t do it. I know that for a sure. So if you&#x27;re in touch with them, Megan, It might be just maybe a bit of an idea to sit down and just go through them one at a time. Karen, You might want to just decide that if there&#x27;s key ones in there actually physically reaching out to them to go, actually, hey, how are you doing? I know Megan&#x27;s been speaking to you, but You know when are you actually buying a bloody house? Yeah Um and then see where we go from there All right.</p><p>Karen Lochhead: Now see that right? So is that under where are my leads? And it&#x27;s where are my leads for this year?</p><p>Bob Duncan: Yep. So under 20252026, you can make it ever and I&#x27;ll break that number up. Yeah,</p><p>Karen Lochhead: That&#x27;s just killing me with 24252526. Yeah, right?</p><p>Bob Duncan: Yep. Okay. So let&#x27;s have a look at applications in progress. Thenum so.</p><p>Bob Duncan: Let&#x27;s find Karen. So, Karen&#x27;s got two hundred fifty thousand apparently in projected business. Not bad, Karen.</p><p>Megan Gordon: You&#x27;ve got bank coming as well.</p><p>Bob Duncan: Yeah, I don&#x27;t know why it&#x27;s pulling bank that I don&#x27;t know, but it doesn&#x27;t do it for everyone. I really don&#x27;t know what&#x27;s happened to that report. No idea like it was totally fine for Craig. And now you do it to Karen now I don&#x27;t know what&#x27;s going on.</p><p>Karen Lochhead: Yeah, cause I&#x27;m special.</p><p>Bob Duncan: Yeah that we know okay. U m. So that&#x27;s telling me at the moment. Um all cases are offer.</p><p>Karen Lochhead: No I think true. Well,</p><p>Bob Duncan: Actually no, the only one I&#x27;ve got is, is that one? Yeah? Yeah, that&#x27;s the only case. It&#x27;s not an offer everything else is 